T* (Based on these considerations, the Guidelines were created using a goal-based approach) Tj
T* (that seeks to achieve policy objectives through non-binding soft law while encouraging) Tj
T* (voluntary efforts by stakeholders, reducing social risks from AI, and promoting AI) Tj
T* (innovation and use.) Tj
T* (Under this understanding, the ministries had previously published the draft AI R&D) Tj
T* (Guidelines for international discussion, the AI Utilization Guidelines, and the) Tj
T* (Governance Guidelines for Implementation of AI Principles Ver. 1.1.) Tj
T* (This time, those three guidelines were integrated and reviewed to reflect the) Tj
T* (characteristics of AI technology that have further developed in recent years and) Tj
T* (discussions on AI social implementation in Japan and abroad.) Tj
T* (The result is a new set of Guidelines for business operators to implement AI social) Tj
T* (deployment and governance together as non-binding soft law.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (In place of the previous guidelines, these Guidelines enable businesses that utilize AI,) Tj
T* (including public institutions such as government and local governments, to confirm) Tj
T* (guiding principles for desirable action for the safe and secure use of AI.) Tj
T* (The Guidelines were formulated with emphasis on effectiveness and legitimacy through) Tj
T* (repeated discussion by a multi-stakeholder group including educational and research) Tj
T* (institutions, civil society including general consumers, and private enterprises, rather) Tj
T* (than by the government alone.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Use of AI can produce large risks to society depending on the field and mode of use, and) Tj
T* (social friction caused by those risks can itself inhibit the use of AI.) Tj
T* (At the same time, excessive measures can also inhibit AI use and the benefits obtained) Tj
T* (through it.) Tj
T* (Therefore, it is important to understand in advance the magnitude of risks that can) Tj
T* (arise from the mode of use in a given field and to align the degree of countermeasures) Tj
T* (with the magnitude of risk under a risk-based approach.) Tj
T* (The Guidelines describe the direction of measures in companies based on this risk-based) Tj
T* (approach.) Tj
T* (This way of thinking is widely shared among advanced AI countries.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (As AI trends change rapidly, the Guidelines are expected to be updated as a Living) Tj
T* (Document under multi-stakeholder participation, taking into account international) Tj
T* (discussion and the concept of agile governance.) Tj
